session_records/

# Local clone of the graphify tool (own git repo — would embed a broken gitlink)
Chimera/tools/graphify/

# Playwright MCP session artifacts (page snapshots/screenshots)
.playwright-mcp/

# Graphify tool output (belongs next to the tool, never in source trees)
graphify-out/

# Content/Chimera/ is REAL hand-authored game content — verb blueprints, footstep
# audio, EVA-suit materials, the sand Niagara systems (SandDrift), ship meshes — and
# belongs in source control. It was wrongly blanket-ignored as "procedurally
# generated", which silently kept ~15 game assets off every fresh clone. If a
# genuinely-generated subdir ever needs excluding, scope the rule to THAT subdir —
# never all of Content/Chimera/.

# Corrupted/malformed directories (non-UTF8 names) — a script mangled an "E:\..."
# Windows path into a literal folder. The old rule escaped the *, matching only a
# literal "E*"; this glob catches the real corrupted dir (E + non-ASCII char).
Chimera/E*/

# Node modules cache (Chimera-local npm; use .pi/npm instead for Pi)
Chimera/node_modules/
Chimera/package.json
Chimera/package-lock.json

# UBT-generated clangd database (regenerate via UBT -Mode=GenerateProjectFiles -VSCode)
Chimera/compile_commands.json

# Test/validation outputs (generated per run)
Chimera/ValidationReports/
test_report_*.json

# One-off LM/context scripts (not part of the core pipeline)
Chimera/context_compressor.py
Chimera/lm.bat
Chimera/lm.ps1
Chimera/LM-Chat.bat
Chimera/LM-Chat.py
Chimera/LM-Ask.bat
Chimera/LM-README.txt
Chimera/mcp_context_server.py
Chimera/start-context-compression.bat

# ─── Repo-hygiene additions (2026-07-09) ─────────────────────────────────────
# node_modules at ANY depth (this is a Python/UE repo — every node_modules is a
# dependency artifact, never source). Supersedes the path-specific rules above.
node_modules/

# Stray root-level npm scaffolding (a 3-line playwright stub; Pi's own deps live
# in .pi/npm/package.json). Leading slash = repo root only.
/package.json
/package-lock.json

# Stale DUPLICATE Pi extensions dir — auto-created when Pi was once launched from
# Chimera/ instead of the repo root. The real extensions live in /.pi/extensions/.
Chimera/.pi/

# AI model weights + HuggingFace download caches — far too large for git.
# Qwen2Audio/ alone is ~6 GB of interrupted .incomplete downloads. These are
# fetched/regenerated, never source; committing them would bloat history forever.
Chimera/Content/AIModels/
Chimera/Content/Qwen2Audio/

# Voice/STT test capture artifacts (regenerated per test run)
Chimera/test_audio.wav
Chimera/test_audio.wav.txt

# Gitignore the world-model data store (SQLite DB + WAL) — it is data, regenerated
Chimera/docs/world/

# CAPCOM operator inbox — machine-local operator scratch, auto-created by
# `python -m core.capcom brief`. Notes are ephemeral/local, not repo content.
Chimera/docs/OPERATOR_INBOX.md

Chimera/scratch/

# MuJoCo writes this next to the process; it is engine spew, not source.
MUJOCO_LOG.TXT

# Grown Matter-Model assets (regenerated by core/bake.py + core/bake_to_ue5.py)
Chimera/Content/Grown/
nul
Build/
.pi-subagents/
Chimera/Content/ProceduralGenerated/Assets/Textures/*.uasset
Chimera/Content/ProceduralGenerated/Assets/Textures/Biomes/*.uasset
ParticleEngine/output/
ParticleEngine/output/
WorldModel/training_data/
WorldModel/training_data/images/
